*(2 marks)* How many times is X printed by the following program (assume every fork succeeds)?
```c
int main(void) {
    for (int i = 0; i < 3; i++) fork();
    printf("X");
    return 0;
}
```

*(2 marks)* How many times is A printed by the following program (assume every fork succeeds)?
```c
int main(void) {
    if (fork() == 0) { fork(); }
    printf("A");
    return 0;
}
```
